    "description": "Sanoh Industrial Co., Ltd. manufactures and sells automotive parts in Japan, North and South America, Europe, China, and Asia. The company offers automotive products, such as brake tubes, brake vacuum tubes, cluster tubes, fuel rail, high pressure type fuel rail, fuel tube, exhaust gas recirculation pipes, shoulder adjuster, seatbelt guide, buckle and tongue, pretensioner tubes, water pipes, quick connectors, oil cooler pipes, aerodynamics products, and cooling module products. It also provides plastic tube assembly, manifold, liquid cooling cooled colling system, valve function fitting, cooling plate, wire capacitor, skin and spiral condenser, and pipe joint assembly; automated cleaning line, shape inspection jig, pneumatic end-forming machine, plastic tube press fitting jig, CNC tube bender, plastic tube press-fitting, and bending and leak inspection automated line; and compact battery pack for AGVs, AMRs, and robots. In addition, the company offers contract substrate processing services for materials, such as GaN, AlN, and SiC; and engages in regional revitalization project. The company was formerly known as Omiya Kohku Kogyo Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Sanoh Industrial Co., Ltd. in March 1952. Sanoh Industrial Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 1939 and is headquartered in Koga, Japan."
